---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";

const htbProfile = "https://profile.hackthebox.com/profile/01a15a74-9995-7379-985f-24e354c2702b";
---

<Base
  title="Security"
  description="Security research, mainly 2019–2021. Hack The Box Hall of Fame, and acknowledgements from NCIIPC and CERT-In."
>
  <h1 class="text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight">Security</h1>
  <p class="mt-4 text-lg leading-relaxed">Before infrastructure, I broke things (responsibly).</p>
  <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-muted">Active mainly 2019–2021, during college.</p>

  <section class="mt-12 border-t border-line pt-8" aria-labelledby="why-heading">
    <h2 id="why-heading" class="text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight">Why</h2>
    <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed">
      I hunted out of curiosity and to understand how systems really work, never for bounties or rewards.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="mt-12 border-t border-line pt-8" aria-labelledby="htb-heading">
    <h2 id="htb-heading" class="text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight">Hack The Box</h2>
    <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed">
      Hall of Fame, during 2019–2021. <a class="link" href={htbProfile}>Hack The Box profile</a>.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="mt-12 border-t border-line pt-8" aria-labelledby="disclosure-heading">
    <h2 id="disclosure-heading" class="text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight">Responsible disclosure</h2>
    <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed">
      I reported vulnerabilities to NCIIPC and CERT-In and received acknowledgements, and responsibly disclosed
      issues to the Jharkhand State Government and MemeChat (letter of appreciation).
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="mt-12 border-t border-line pt-8" aria-labelledby="practice-heading">
    <h2 id="practice-heading" class="text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight">Practice</h2>
    <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed">Reverse engineering and packet analysis.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="mt-12 border-t border-line pt-8" aria-labelledby="since-heading">
    <h2 id="since-heading" class="text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight">Since then</h2>
    <p class="todo">
      TODO: Priyam — adjust this close if you want different wording. These days I build systems rather than break
      them, but that habit of thinking like an attacker still shapes how I design backends and infrastructure.
    </p>
  </section>
</Base>
